    "也可以在“系统设置 → 通用 → 语言与地区 → App”中为任务看板单独设置语言。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also set TaskBoard's language in System Settings → General → Language & Region → Applications."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以在「系統設定 → 一般 → 語言與地區 → App」中為任務看板單獨設定語言。"
